<%- include("partials/_header") %>

<main class="main">
  <div class="label-title">
    <h4>ABOUT SILLY STORIES:</h4>
  </div>

  <p class="description">
    Silly Stories began in May 2020 with a simple idea: what if strangers could
    write a story together without knowing where it was going?
    <br />
    <br />
    One person leaves a sentence behind. Someone else finds it, imagines what
    might happen next, and carries the story a little further. Each writer sees
    only the last sentence, so no one knows how it will end.
    <br />
    <br />
    After <%= sentenceLimit %> sentences, all the hidden pieces come together.
    The finished tale joins the Silly Archive, ready to surprise the people who
    created it—and a new blank page waits for the next adventure.
  </p>

  <%- include("partials/_menu") %>
</main>
</body>

</html>
